(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[14] = {"n": 14, "title": "Noun Inflection and Fixed Endings", "ar": "إِعْرَابُ الاِسْمِ وَبِنَاؤُهُ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>This module connects a word’s role to its ending. For each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>, ask: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما العامل؟ ما الموقع؟ أمعرب هو أم مبني؟ ما علامة الإعراب أو البناء؟</span></b> Explain in English when helpful, but name the grammar in Arabic.</p><p>Recall <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل، مفعول به، مبتدأ، خبر، مضاف، مضاف إليه، نعت، توكيد، ظرف، حال</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> normally requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span>. These requirements do not tell you whether the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> will be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة، فتحة، كسرة، حرف</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة</span>.</p><p>Useful prerequisites: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المثنّى</span></b> refers to two; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المؤنث السالم</span></b> use regular added forms; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجمع المكسّر</span></b> changes the internal form. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span></b> represents a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متكلّم، مخاطب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غائب</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span></b> states it directly. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span></b> can retain its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>’s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span></b> is an expression understood as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن أقرأ = القراءة</span>.</p><p>Work through guided choices, then cover the options and predict the answer before independent practice. Every question and every table row has one correct choice. Later tasks use less <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضبط</span> and less English. When a construction permits several analyses, the question specifies the account to use.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "Three ways of expressing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Core rule and vocabulary</h2><p>Find the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and role first; then explain how the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> is expressed. An unchanged written ending does not by itself prove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>What to recognise</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظي</span></td><td>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> is pronounced</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ المؤمنُ: ضمة ظاهرة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب تقديري</span></td><td>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مانع</span> prevents the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> from appearing</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ الفتى: ضمة مقدّرة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب محلّي</span></td><td>The construction has a grammatical place without displaying its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> there</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ هذا: في محل رفع فاعل</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر</span></b> = expressed; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّر</span></b> = understood but unexpressed; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلّ</span></b> = grammatical place; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مانع</span></b> = something preventing expression; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span></b> governs a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span></b> responds to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظي</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديري</span>; a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span></b> retains its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> while its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> may change.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> separate</h2><p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء, علامات الإعراب</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركات (ضمة، فتحة، كسرة</span>) or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف (واو، ألف، ياء). علامات البناء</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمّ، فتح، كسر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span>. Say <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span></b> but <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمّ</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> does not establish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> belongs to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول. أسماء</span> normally have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الأفعال</span> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها من الإعراب. حروف</span> also have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> may have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> or no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> according to its relationship. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span> entering a construction governed by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> may have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>, although its ending remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>. This module concentrates on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَاءَ هَذَا. رَأَيْتُ هَذَا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">This person came. I saw this person.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة مبني على السكون في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأى فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل؛ التاء ضمير مبني على الضم في محل رفع فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة مبني على السكون في محل نصب مفعول به</span>.</li></ul><p>The role changes; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span> does not. By contrast, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ الفتى</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة مقدّرة</span> on a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Core rule and vocabulary"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> separate"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the highlighted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد فاعل مرفوع بضمة ظاهرة؛ الفتى فاعل مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة؛ هذا مبني في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ خالدٌ: خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديري</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلّي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ الفتى: الفتى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديري</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا إعراب له</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ هذا: هذا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلّي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديري</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the complete description of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ هذا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل. هذا</span> receives the seeing and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة منصوب بفتحة ظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة مبني على السكون في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “The ending of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى</span> stays the same, so it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>.”", "sol": "<p>The final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> prevents the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركات</span> from appearing. This is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب تقديري</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى معرب؛ إعرابه تقديري</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى حرف لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which description distinguishes a role from its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is the relationship; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> is one possible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة. خبر</span> can also be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل مبني لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لأنّ كل ضمة فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع، وعلامة رفعه الضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيتِ</span></b>, which part has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول, مجرور بكسرة ظاهرة</span>.</p>", "group": "1R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت مجرور؛ في حرف لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في مرفوع؛ البيت مبني</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يظهر في اللفظ لمانع</span></b> describes which feature?", "sol": "<p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مانع</span> prevents expression of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>; it does not remove the role or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انعدام العامل دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة مقدّرة مع وجود الإعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء كل اسم آخره حرف علة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإعراب بالحركة</span>", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">Three patterns</h2><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span></b> is one, as distinct from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر</span></b> changes the form of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span>, such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span></b> accepts the ordinary pattern below; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span></b> has a different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> pattern and does not take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> in that pattern.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الموحّد والجمع المكسّر المنصرف الصحيح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسولُ، الكتبُ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسولَ، الكتبَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسولِ، الكتبِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجاري مجرى الصحيح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهَدْيُ، اللَّغْوُ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهَدْيَ، اللَّغْوَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهَدْيِ، اللَّغْوِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المنصرف</span>, without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدُ، أنبياءُ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ، أنبياءَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ، أنبياءَ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المؤنث السالم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤمناتٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤمناتٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤمناتٍ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصحيح</span></b> ends in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف صحيح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجاري مجرى الصحيح</span></b> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> preceded by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span>: the final letter can bear the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركات</span>. Do not confuse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهَدْي</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهُدَى</span></b>.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر غير المنصرف</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالفتحة</span> in the stated setting; with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> it takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكسرة</span>. The detailed causes of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span> are a separate topic. For now, names explicitly labelled <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span> can be used without guessing the cause.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملحق بمجموع المؤنث السالم</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أولات</span></b> means women possessing something: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ أولاتُ علمٍ؛ رأيتُ أولاتِ علمٍ؛ مررتُ بأولاتِ علمٍ</span></b>. It follows the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات</span>. So does a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم</span> on this form, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عرفاتٌ، عرفاتٍ</span></b> in the pattern used here. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> can therefore indicate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> as well as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> decides.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَأَيْتُ المُؤْمِنَاتِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I saw the believing women.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وتاء الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤمناتِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالكسرة لأنه مجموع مؤنث سالم</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بالمؤمناتِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء حرف جر؛ المؤمنات اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "Three patterns"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملحق بمجموع المؤنث السالم</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the completion.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span> require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب. المؤمنات</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب, الكتب فتحة. أحمد</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالفتحة لأنه غير منصرف</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ … (المؤمنات</span>)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤمناتَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤمناتِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤمناتُ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بـ … (أحمد، غير منصرف</span>)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ … (الكتب</span>)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتبُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتبِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتبَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهَدْيُ</span></b> have an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span>?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دال</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span>. This differs from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضي</span>, whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ياء تمنع ظهور الضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء قبلها ساكن؛ فهو جار مجرى الصحيح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ أولاتَ علمٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أولات ملحق بمجموع المؤنث السالم: مفعول به منصوب بالكسرة، وهو مضاف؛ علمٍ مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ أولاتِ علمٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ أولاتْ علمٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ أولاتُ علمٍ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify roles in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرت المؤمنات. أكرمت المؤمنات. سلّمت على المؤمنات</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرتِ المؤمناتُ؛ أكرمتُ المؤمناتِ؛ سلّمتُ على المؤمناتِ</span>. The last two share <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكسرة</span> but differ in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and role.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤمنات</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بعلى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤمنات</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالكسرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤمنات</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which statement is correct?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> because of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء. علامة الجر</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة النصب</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>.</p>", "group": "2R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤمناتِ</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء مجرور، وإن كانت علامته الفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء منصوب لأن عليه فتحة</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجاري مجرى الصحيح ما في آخره واو أو ياء قبلهما ساكن</span>.</b> Choose its example.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللَّغْو</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> preceded by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون. القاضي</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى مقصور</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللَّغْو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإعراب بالحرف</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">The three families</h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأسماء الخمسة</span> under their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبوك</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أباك</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبيك</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المثنّى</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمانِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَيْنِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَيْنِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمونَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمِينَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمِينَ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأسماء الخمسة</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أب، أخ، حم، فو، ذو</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حم</span> concerns relationship through marriage; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو</span> means possessing. Their letter pattern requires a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span> in its ordinary full form, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى غير ياء المتكلم. فو</span> uses this form without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميم</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فمٌ</span></b> takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركات</span>. Use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو</span> in the meaning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب</span>, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو علمٍ</span></b>. Without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبٌ، أبًا، أبٍ</span></b>; with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span>, study <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبي</span></b> in Lesson 5.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا وكلتا</span></b> take the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> pattern when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضافتان إلى ضمير</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما، كليهما؛ كلتاهما، كلتيهما</span></b>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الوالدان كلاهما</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد مرفوع بالألف، وهو مضاف؛ هما مضاف إليه</span>. Their construction with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> is different (Lesson 5).</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">Endings and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملحقات</span></h2><p>In the ordinary full forms, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون المثنّى</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون مجموع المذكّر السالم</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الإعراب</span>. Drop it in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّما خالدٍ؛ معلّمو خالدٍ؛ رأيتُ معلّمي خالدٍ</span></b>. The last form can represent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> depending on context, so identify the intended number before analysis.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أولو</span></b> (possessors), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون وأخواتها</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثون</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسعون</span>), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سنون</span></b> (years), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عضون</span></b> (parts) and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبون</span></b> (groups) are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملحقات بمجموع المذكّر السالم: رفع بالواو، نصب وجر بالياء</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أولو علمٍ / أولي علمٍ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\">Recognition notes</h2><p>Less common forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أب وأخ وهن</span> include <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النقص</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركات</span> on the shortened form (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبُه، أبَه، أبِه</span>), and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القصر</span></b>, keeping <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> in all three positions (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أباه</span>). These are recognised usages, not the default pattern for completion exercises. Another use of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو</span></b> means <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span></b> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على سكون الواو</span>; it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو</span> meaning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَرَرْتُ بِأَخِيكَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I passed your brother.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وتاء الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخي</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالياء لأنه من الأسماء الخمسة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مبني على الفتح في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> here expresses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>; it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "The three families"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "Endings and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملحقات</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "Recognition notes"}, {"id": "L3-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete using the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأسماء الخمسة</span> pattern.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخو فاعل مرفوع بالواو؛ أخا مفعول به منصوب بالألف؛ أخي مجرور بعلى بالياء</span>. All are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى الكاف</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span> …", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخيك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخوك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخاك</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span> …", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخوك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخيك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخاك</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّمت على</span> …", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخاك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخيك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخوك</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the form to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المثنى يرفع بالألف؛ مجموع المذكّر السالم ينصب بالياء؛ أولو ملحق به فيرفع بالواو. النون ليست علامة الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون للرفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء للرفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف للرفع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت المعلّمين، والمقصود مجموع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو للنصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء للنصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون للنصب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر أولو العلم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف للنصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضمة الظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو للرفع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ الوالدين</span> …</b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كليهما توكيد منصوب بالياء لإضافته إلى ضمير. كلتاهما</span> also has the wrong <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> form and is for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كليهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Using the ordinary full pattern, correct <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمونَ خالدٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> removes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون. معلّمو فاعل مرفوع بالواو، وهو مضاف؛ خالد مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمونُ خالدٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمو خالدٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمينَ خالدٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أبٌ</span></b> not completed with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبو</span>?", "sol": "<p>The letter pattern requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة. أبٌ</span> here is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>.</p>", "group": "3R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أب هنا مجموع مؤنث سالم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يضف أب إلى اسم آخر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل أب مبني</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو بمعنى الذي مبني على سكون الواو</span>.</b> Which follows?", "sol": "<p>Meaning determines which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو</span> is present. The special <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو الموصولة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأسماء الخمسة</span> pattern.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا نطبّق عليه آليًّا إعراب ذو بمعنى صاحب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو بمعنى الذي حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ذو مرفوع بالواو</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقصور والمنقوص</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">Look before the last letter</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مقصور</span></b> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>, written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ا</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ى</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العصا، الفتى، الهدى</span></b>. All its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركات</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> cannot bear them: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التعذّر</span></b>. A spelling ending in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ى</span> is not enough to make a word <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منقوص</span></b> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> preceded by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضي، العاصي</span></b>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرتان</span> because of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثقل</span></b>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهرة</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نوع</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور منصرف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الفتى: ضمة مقدّرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت الفتى: فتحة مقدّرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بالفتى: كسرة مقدّرة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور غير منصرف</span> in its ordinary pattern</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء عيسى: ضمة مقدّرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت عيسى: فتحة مقدّرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بعيسى: فتحة مقدّرة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء القاضي: ضمة مقدّرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت القاضيَ: فتحة ظاهرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بالقاضي: كسرة مقدّرة</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\">When the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> disappears</h2><p>An ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> and without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> loses its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء قاضٍ؛ مررت بقاضٍ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة على الياء المحذوفة</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>, keep the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> and express <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتحة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت قاضيًا</span></b>. Do not infer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> from the visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضٍ</span> without checking the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>.</p><p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقصور</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتًى</span></b> can likewise occupy <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع، نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> does not replace the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>. In less usual usage, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> may also be left <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة للثقل</span>; completion questions here use the ordinary expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَلَّمَ الفَتَى عَلَى القَاضِي</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The young man greeted the judge.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة على الألف للتعذّر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضي</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بكسرة مقدّرة على الياء للثقل. الجار والمجرور متعلقان بسلّم</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "Look before the last letter"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "When the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> disappears"}, {"id": "L4-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each final form.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العصا</span> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف؛ القاضي</span> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة؛ الهَدْي</span> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العصا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار مجرى الصحيح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار مجرى الصحيح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهَدْي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار مجرى الصحيح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ القاضيَ</span></b>, what is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضي مفعول به منصوب</span>. The ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span> expresses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتحة</span>, though it does not express <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضمة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكسرة</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة ظاهرة على الياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة مقدّرة على الألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة ظاهرة على الياء</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete the ordinary form: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر … جديدٌ</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاض</span>).", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضٍ فاعل مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة على الياء المحذوفة. جديدٌ نعت مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضيًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضْ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حمل الفتى العصا. مرّ بعيسى</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيسى</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى</span> is the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى والعصا مقصوران. عيسى مقصور غير منصرف</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> represented by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة مقدّرة</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بفتحة ظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني في محل جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العصا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيسى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بكسرة ظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بفتحة مقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بفتحة ظاهرة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which pair has different ways of expressing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السكون</span> before the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهَدْي</span> allows a visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة. ألف</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهُدَى</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>.</p>", "group": "4R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضي والفتى: ضمتان ظاهرتان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهَدْيُ والهُدَى: مبنيّان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهَدْيُ: ظاهر؛ الهُدَى: مقدّر</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنقوص ما في آخره ياء قبلها كسرة</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ مثال يوافق التعريف؟</span>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الداعي</span> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> preceded by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة. الفتى</span> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللغو</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الداعي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللَّغْو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "Special patterns of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب تقديري</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا وكلتا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span></h2><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الوالدان كلاهما</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء كلا الوالدين</span></b>. When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضافتان إلى ضمير, كلا وكلتا</span> display <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وجر</span>. When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضافتان إلى اسم ظاهر</span>, their form stays <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا / كلتا</span></b>.</p><p>Use this analytical account consistently: with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع بالألف المقدّرة، نصب وجر بالياء المقدّرة</span></b>. Thus <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ كلا الوالدين</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا مفعول به منصوب بالياء المقدّرة، وهو مضاف؛ الوالدين مضاف إليه مجرور بالياء</span>. Do not transfer the visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوالدين</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضاف إلى ياء المتكلم</span></h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span> means “my” in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابي</span></b> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>. In an ordinary form such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابي</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ربّي</span>, the letter before it carries <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> appropriate to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>. Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع بالضمة المقدّرة، نصب بالفتحة المقدّرة، جر بالكسرة الظاهرة</span></b> in the account followed here.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرَ أبي. رأيتُ أبي. مررتُ بأبي</span>.</b> Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى ياء المتكلم</span>, so it does not use the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأسماء الخمسة</span> letter pattern. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بأبيك</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> there marks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p><p>This ordinary pattern is not a reason to discard the endings of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المثنّى</span> or other special forms: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء معلّمايَ؛ رأيتُ معلّمَيَّ</span></b> retain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف/ياء المثنّى</span>. In a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span>, also inspect the final letter and its own <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مانع</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span></h2><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> drops for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّميَّ</span></b>, the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياءان</span> combine; in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>, the original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> changes to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إدغام</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span>. Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء معلّميَّ</span></b> (several teachers) as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالواو المقدّرة</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ معلّميَّ؛ مررتُ بمعلّميَّ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالياء</span>; the other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مضاف إليه</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَاءَ كِلَا المُعَلِّمَيْنِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Both teachers came.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف المقدّرة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمين</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالياء لأنه مثنّى. كلا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> here; in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء المعلّمان كلاهما</span></b>, it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا وكلتا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضاف إلى ياء المتكلم</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the analysis taught here.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا/كلتا</span> requires the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> account taught here. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما, كليهما</span> displays the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> required by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء كلا الوالدين: كلا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف الظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف المقدّرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت الوالدين كليهما: كلي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد منصوب بالياء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى كلتا المرأتين: كلتا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء المقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء الظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نظرتُ إلى كتابي</span></b>, choose the analysis used in this module.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span>. In this account <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالكسرة الظاهرة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span>, which is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب مجرور بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة؛ الياء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب مجرور بالكسرة الظاهرة؛ الياء مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why do <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بأبي</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بأبيك</span></b> need different explanations?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بأبي: أب مجرور بالكسرة الظاهرة في هذا التحليل والياء مضاف إليه. بأبيك: أبي مجرور بالياء من الأسماء الخمسة والكاف مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء في الأولى علامة جر الأسماء الخمسة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأولى مضافة إلى ياء المتكلم؛ الثانية إلى الكاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما مثنّى</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقصود في الجمل الثلاث مجموع من المعلّمين</span>. Choose the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>.", "sol": "<p>The same form has different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات: واو مقدّرة للرفع؛ ياء للنصب والجر. ياء المتكلم</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> throughout.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّميَّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف ظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو مقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة ظاهرة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمت معلّميَّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة ظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو ظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء للنصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّمت على معلّميَّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف مقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة ظاهرة على الميم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء للجر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التحليل في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت كلا المعلّمين</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بحسب هذا الدرس</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span> supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء. كلا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى اسم ظاهر</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمين مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "5R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا مفعول به منصوب بالياء المقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمين فاعل مرفوع بالياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا توكيد مرفوع بالألف الظاهرة</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضافتان إلى اسم ظاهر</span></b>: which expression satisfies this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المرأتين</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر. هما</span> in the other two expressions is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتا المرأتين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كليهما</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإعراب المحلّي</span> and layered relationships", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">Three settings</h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب محلّي</span> is not confined to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>. It also describes an <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span></b>, or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> whose end is already occupied by a different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظي</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريدُ أن أسافرَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن أسافر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل بمعنى السفر</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span>. Internally, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن حرف مصدري ناصب؛ أسافر فعل مضارع منصوب بالفتحة وفاعله مستتر تقديره أنا</span>. The whole expression and its parts have different analyses.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظ</span> and relationship</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما ربُّنا بظالمٍ</span></b>: with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما العاملة عمل ليس, ربّ اسم ما مرفوع ومضاف، نا مضاف إليه؛ الباء زائدة؛ ظالم خبر ما مجرور لفظًا منصوب محلًّا</span>. “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span>” does not remove its effect on the pronounced ending.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نؤمنُ ببعثِ اللهِ عبادَه</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعث</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مضاف إلى فاعله</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا بالإضافة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع محلًّا على الفاعلية للمصدر</span> in this account; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبادَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به للمصدر منصوب، وهو مضاف؛ الهاء مضاف إليه</span>. Keep the source of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> relationship visible in the analysis.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قريب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعيد</span></h2><p>For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>, even the immediate relationship is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلّي</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سؤالُهم</span></b> meaning “their asking,” <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر قريب</span></b> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل المصدر</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع بعيد</span></b>. If <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سؤالهم</span> instead means “questioning them,” the distant relationship changes to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب على المفعولية</span>. Meaning must be specified before choosing it.</p><p>These are layered accounts of one expression, not two pronounced endings on one word. With a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللهِ</span> above, the immediate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظي</span>, while the underlying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلية</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلّي</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُرِيدُ أَنْ أَقْرَأَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I want to read.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريدُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مرفوع بالضمة، وفاعله مستتر تقديره أنا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مصدري ناصب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع منصوب بالفتحة، وفاعله مستتر تقديره أنا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن أقرأ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل في محل نصب مفعول به لأريد</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "Three settings"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظ</span> and relationship"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قريب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعيد</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريد أن أقرأ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>Do not assign the whole expression’s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span> alone. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريد</span> governs the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم المؤوّل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأ</span> internally.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به وحده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مصدري ناصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع منصوب وفاعله مستتر أنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن أقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له كله</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع لفظًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما ربّنا بظالمٍ</span></b>, take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العاملة عمل ليس</span>. Analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظالم</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء الزائدة</span> produces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر لفظي</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظالم</span> retains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا منصوب محلًّا خبر ما</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عجبتُ من سؤالِهم</span></b> meaning “I was surprised at their asking,” analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم مبني</span>. Its immediate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جر</span>; their role as those asking is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع بعيد على الفاعلية للمصدر</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع قريب وجر بعيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر قريب بالإضافة ورفع بعيد على الفاعلية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بكسرة ظاهرة</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نؤمن ببعث الله عبادَه</span></b>, what governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبادَ</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعث مصدر عامل أضيف إلى فاعله. عباد مفعول به له منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف؛ الهاء مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء في آخر عباد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المصدر بعث</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء مباشرة</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which claim must be corrected?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب محلّي</span> also applies to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span> and the further relationship of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span> whose end has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظي</span> already.</p>", "group": "6R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن أقرأ اسم مؤوّل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء حرف لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل إعراب محلّي يختص باسم مبني فقط</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا منصوب محلًّا</span></b>: what should a complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> preserve?", "sol": "<p>Describe both the visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> and the relationship requiring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>, as in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء الزائدة</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجر وحده وإلغاء العامل الآخر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجر الظاهر والعلاقة التي تقتضي النصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النصب الظاهر على آخر الكلمة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني الأصلي والمبني العارض</span>", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">Core distinction</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني الأصلي</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني من حيث اللفظ</span>) retains its ending as a property of the word: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا، الذي</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبني العارض</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني من حيث المحل</span>) is ordinarily <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span> but enters a construction requiring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا نوحُ؛ لا خيرَ في الظلم؛ من قبلُ</span></b> under its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>.</p><p>Another name for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير متمكّن</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متمكّن</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متمكّن أمكن</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متمكّن غير أمكن</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span> is still <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\">Common families</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضمائر</span></b> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنية: أنا، نحن، هو، هي، هم، أنتَ، أنتِ</span>, and attached forms such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ـه، ـك، ـنا</span>. Identify the particular role: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو حاضرٌ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع مبتدأ</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُه</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابُه</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جر مضاف إليه</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الإشارة</span></b> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا، هذه، ذلك</span>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأسماء الموصولة</span></b> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي، التي</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنية</span>. Their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> forms <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذان/هذين، هاتان/هاتين، اللذان/اللذين، اللتان/اللتين</span></b> follow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب المثنّى</span>. A family label is not a licence to ignore these forms. For the ordinarily <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span></b>, distinguish its uses rather than treating every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام</span> identically.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء عارض</span></h2><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنادى المفرد</span></b> here means neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة مقصودة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على ما يرفع به في محل نصب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا خالدُ</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة غير مقصودة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>, as is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضاف</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا طالبًا، يا طالبَ العلمِ</span></b>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا لنفي الجنس</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> in this same structural sense: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ هنا</span></b>. If <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span>, it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ علمٍ هنا</span></b>. Similar spelling can conceal different analyses.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل وبعد</span></b> with omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> intended in meaning can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيتين على الضم</span>; the next lesson supplies the contrast.</li></ul><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَا خَالِدُ، لَا طَالِبَ هُنَا</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مبني على الضم في محل نصب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لنفي الجنس</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا مبني على الفتح في محل نصب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان مبني في محل نصب، متعلق بخبر لا المحذوف</span>. Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span> are examples of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء عارض</span> here.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "Core distinction"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "Common families"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء عارض</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each use.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> is intrinsically <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني. خالد</span> becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> in the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span> but returns to ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> outside it.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو في هو حاضر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني عارض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني أصلي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب غير منصرف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد في يا خالدُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني أصلي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني عارض في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد في جاء خالدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا طالبَ علمٍ هنا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه. اسم لا المضاف</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>, so do not call its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة بناء</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا مبني على الفتح لأنه مفرد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لا منصوب بالفتحة لأنه مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ تحليل صحيح في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت هذين</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الإشارة</span> follow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب المثنّى</span>. Here the role is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذين مجرور بالياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذين اسم إشارة منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذين مبني على السكون في محل رفع</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو قرأ كتابه. أكرمه المعلّم</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، حدّد محلّ كل ضمير</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو مبتدأ؛ قرأ وفاعله المستتر جملة خبر. هاء كتابه مضاف إليه؛ هاء أكرمه مفعول به مقدّم على الفاعل المعلّم</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو في أول الكلام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء في كتابه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء في أكرمه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the correct contrast.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span> changes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> pattern; it is not the same as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>.</p>", "group": "7R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المنصرف وغير المتمكّن مترادفان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المنصرف معرب؛ غير المتمكّن مبني</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ضمير معرب</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحل يقتضي بناءه</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفسّر أيّ مثال؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span> construction requires this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء عارض. نوح</span> can show ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> elsewhere.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ في حضر خالدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نوحُ في يا نوحُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ في من كتابٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "Which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظروف</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنية</span>?", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">Organise by meaning and construction</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان</span></b> locates an event in time; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مكان</span></b> locates it in place. Being a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span> does not itself require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فوق وتحت</span></b> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معربان</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Group</th><th>Forms and use</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحَ مساءَ</span>: both parts <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيان على الفتح</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقطوع عن الإضافة</span> with its meaning intended</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلُ، بعدُ: مبنيان على الضم</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى، أين، أنّى</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> in the classification here</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> in the classification here</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّان</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثما</span></td></tr><tr><td>Other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني ظروف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثُ، إذْ، لدى، لدنْ، قطُّ، عوضُ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّى</span></b> can ask from where/how according to context. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطّ</span></b> covers past time in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام منفي</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كذبتُ قطُّ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوض</span></b> usually covers future time and can cover past time. When not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف, عوض</span> has transmitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الضم أو الكسر أو الفتح</span>; use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضم</span> in exercises here. If <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>, it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عوضَ العائضين</span></b>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل وبعد</span>: omission needs a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جئتُ من قبلُ</span></b>: the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> remains intended in meaning; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل مبني على الضم في محل جر</span>. It is called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غاية</span></b> because the expression ends at the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> after its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> is removed. With explicit <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلِ الدرسِ</span></b>. With no intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلٍ</span></b>. Do not call every isolated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل مبني</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مضاف إلى جملة</span></h2><p>For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوم</span> capable of this construction, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span></b> when followed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومَ التقى الجمعان</span></b> can have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوم منصوب بالفتحة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل نصب</span>. The identical sound does not decide between them.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرجوح</span></b> when the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>, or the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمية</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا يومُ ينفعُ الصادقين صدقُهم؛ هذا يومُ المالُ لا ينفعُ</span></b>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب يوم</span> is preferred. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span> means preferred, not obligatory; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرجوح</span> means less preferred, not impossible.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِئْتُ مِنْ قَبْلُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I came earlier.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جئتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وتاء الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم في محل جر بمن، مقطوع عن الإضافة مع نيّة معناها. الجار والمجرور متعلقان بجئت</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلستُ فوقَ الكرسيِّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فوق ظرف مكان منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف؛ الكرسي مضاف إليه</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "Organise by meaning and construction"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل وبعد</span>: omission needs a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مضاف إلى جملة</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish the three constructions.", "sol": "<p>Only the first has the omitted-but-intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> that produces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الضم</span>. The other two show <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر لفظي</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلُ، مع نيّة معنى المضاف إليه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلِ الدرس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب مجرور بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من قبلٍ، بلا نيّة إضافة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى اسم مذكور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب مجرور منوّن</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the best description of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطُّ</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كذبتُ قطُّ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان مبني على الضم في محل نصب. ما حرف نفي</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كذبت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف لاستغراق الماضي مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بما</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل الحكم: بناء يوم في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوم التقى الجمعان</span></b> ….", "sol": "<p>The following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>. Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> are possible; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح مع جواز الإعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واجب لا يجوز غيره</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممتنع</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا يومُ ينفعُ الصادقين صدقُهم</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، ما الحكم المختار ليوم؟</span>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينفع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع معرب. يوم</span> is preferably <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالضمة، وهو مضاف إلى الجملة</span>. The alternative <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرجوح</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإعراب أرجح لأن الفعل بعده معرب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوم حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البناء واجب لأن بعده جملة</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ عبارة تصحّ؟</span>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span> is a role; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> is a property requiring its own evidence.</p>", "group": "8R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فوق وتحت معربان، فليست الظروف كلّها مبنية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلُ بعد من فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ظرف مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح لا واجب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعني</span>:", "sol": "<p>The expression preserves the difference between preference and necessity.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتساوى الوجهان في كل شرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يُفضّل هذا الوجه مع جواز غيره</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يمتنع غير هذا الوجه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الاستفهام والشرط والكنايات</span>", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">Read the use in context</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Meaning and use in this classification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعاقل؛ استفهام</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغير العاقل؛ استفهام</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span></td><td>selecting one; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>; ordinarily <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف</span></td><td>asking how, or corresponding manner in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مهما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لغير العاقل</span>, and can express <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أينما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>These are grammatical uses, not a rule that every written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن حضر؟</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام</span>) and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن البيت</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>). In the account used here, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذما</span> is included among <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الشرط للزمان</span>. Keep <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span></b> distinct from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذما</span></b>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span></b> is an important <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span> within this meaning group: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ كتابٍ نافعٌ؟ أيَّ كتابٍ قرأتَ؟ بأيِّ كتابٍ بدأتَ؟</span></b> It takes its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> from its role and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> in all three. Do not label it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> just because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيتان</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\">Some <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كنايات</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنية</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كناية</span></b> here is a placeholder rather than a specific name or exact wording. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كذا وكذا، كيت وكيت، ذيت وذيت</span></b> represent unspecified things, speech or action. Learn the repeated forms joined by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> in this usage: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعتُ كذا وكذا؛ قال كيتَ وكيتَ؛ فعل ذيتَ وذيتَ</span></b>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الخبرية</span></b> conveys a large unspecified quantity: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم رجلٍ صالحٍ لقيتُه</span>!</b> It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنية</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز مجرور</span>. Distinguish asking <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم كتابًا قرأتَ؟</span></b>, where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم استفهامية</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا تمييز منصوب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بضع، فلان، فلانة</span></b> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كنايات معربة</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنية</span> merely because their reference is unspecified.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَيَّ كِتَابٍ قَرَأْتَ؟</span></b> <span class=\"gl\">Which book did you read?</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام مفعول به مقدّم منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل؛ التاء ضمير مبني على الفتح في محل رفع فاعل</span>. The earlier position of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> reflects <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>; it does not make it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> here.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "Read the use in context"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "Some <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كنايات</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنية</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الوصف المناسب</span>.", "sol": "<p>The same bare spelling <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> can conceal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن. مهما</span> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الشرط</span> in the classification taught here.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن حضر؟</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام للعاقل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كناية معربة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مهما في الاستعمال المدروس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بـ … كتابٍ بدأتَ؟</span></b>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر: أيّ اسم استفهام مجرور بالكسرة وهو مضاف؛ كتابٍ مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيِّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ مجموعة كلّها كنايات معربة؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The first group follows ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>. Unspecified reference alone does not cause <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الخبرية، كذا، فلان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كذا، كيت، ذيت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بضع، فلان، فلانة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم رجلٍ صالحٍ لقيته</span>!</b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، كم خبرية. اختر تحليل رجل</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الخبرية</span> is followed here by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز مجرور: رجلٍ؛ صالحٍ نعت له</span>. The attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لقيته</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز مجرور</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحّح</span>: “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ مبنية دائمًا لأنها اسم استفهام</span>.”", "sol": "<p>The meaning category does not erase <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>. Here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p>", "group": "9R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ معربة في أيَّ كتابٍ قرأتَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ حرف لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثما للمكان والزمان</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الاستنتاج الصحيح؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The classification allows both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زمان</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>. Determine the intended meaning from context.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثما لا تأتي إلا للاستفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حيثما معربة دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعيّن السياق المعنى المراد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "10", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المركّب المزجي والمحكي</span>", "short": "Lesson 10", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s1\">Two components functioning as one</h2><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب مزجي غير علم</span></b> joins two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> into one expression. In the forms here, both components are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيان على الفتح</span></b>; the whole expression has the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> required by its role.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Use</th><th>Example</th><th>Whole expression</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقمتُ ثلاثةَ عشرَ يومًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب ظرف زمان؛ يومًا تمييز منصوب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أزورُه صباحَ مساءَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب ظرف زمان</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدُ جاري بيتَ بيتَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال</span>, meaning adjoining house to house</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Numbers <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد عشر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة عشر</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسعة عشر</span> follow this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> pattern. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنا عشر / اثني عشر</span></b> must be kept distinct: its first component follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب المثنّى</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>. Do not generalise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء الجزأين</span> to that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>. These patterns do not themselves teach all the rules of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span>; here use the supplied forms.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحكي</span> keeps what was heard</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحكي</span></b> is wording reproduced <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على هيئته من غير تغيير</span></b>. When a fixed title <b>«<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمُ نافعٌ</span>»</b> is being mentioned, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span> «<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمُ نافعٌ</span>»</b> preserves its internal form; the quoted title as a whole occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span>. Do not change <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافعٌ</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافعًا</span> to mark the outer role.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحكاية</span> can also preserve an individual form: someone says <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ زيدًا</span></b>; the reply <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن زيدًا؟</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيدًا</span> as heard. Treat this as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكاية</span>, not as a general pattern requiring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الأصوات</span></h2><p>Forms such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غاقِ</span></b> imitate the raven's cry; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نخّ</span></b> is used to make a camel kneel. These are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنية</span>, resembling <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف مهملة</span> in being neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>. As sound uses, they have <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها من الإعراب</span></b>. Do not assign them an invented <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> merely because they are called <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَضَرَ الطَّالِبُ صَبَاحَ مَسَاءَ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباح مساء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان مركّب مبني على فتح الجزأين في محل نصب، متعلق بحضر</span>. This construction combines the two time words with the sense of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباحًا ومساءً</span>; the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحات</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, not two independent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات نصب</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L10-s1", "title": "Two components functioning as one"}, {"id": "L10-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحكي</span> keeps what was heard"}, {"id": "L10-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الأصوات</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "10G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيّن وظيفة المركّب</span>.", "sol": "<p>The same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> pattern supports different roles. In the first, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومًا</span> is separately <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>; the number expression gives the duration.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقمت ثلاثةَ عشرَ يومًا: ثلاثة عشر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب ظرف زمان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أزوره صباحَ مساءَ: صباح مساء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمان معربان مجروران</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مبني على فتح الجزأين</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد جاري بيتَ بيتَ: بيت بيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مبني على فتح الجزأين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "10G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A fixed title is <b>«<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمُ نافعٌ</span>»</b>. Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span> …</b> while quoting the title exactly.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحكاية</span> preserves the title. Its outer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب مفعول به</span> does not change its internal wording.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "opts": ["«<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمِ نافعٍ</span>»", "«<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمَ نافعًا</span>»", "«<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمُ نافعٌ</span>»"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ تحليل صحيح في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر اثنا عشر طالبًا</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؟</span>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنا</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب المثنّى. عشر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبًا تمييز منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنا منصوب بالياء؛ طالبًا فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنا فاعل مرفوع بالألف؛ عشر مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنا عشر مبني على فتح الجزأين</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "10I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قال شخص</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت زيدًا</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فقيل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من زيدًا؟</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لماذا بقي النصب؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The reply reproduces the form heard. It does not establish a new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> rule for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للحكاية على الهيئة المسموعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأن زيدًا ظرف زمان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأن من الاستفهامية تنصب كل اسم بعدها</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التحليل لغاقِ حين يحاكي صوت الغراب</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الأصوات</span> in this use are neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>. The fixed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p>", "group": "10R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم صوت مبني لا محل له من الإعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "10-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من غير تغيير فيه</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في تعريف المحكي يمنع أيّ عمل؟</span>", "sol": "<p>You may identify the whole quoted expression’s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> while preserving its internal form.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعيين محل العبارة المحكية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فهم العبارة المحكية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تبديل ضبط العبارة المحكية لمجرد تغيّر محلها الخارجي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Begin with the relationships; then justify every ending. In connected passages, track the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمائر</span> across <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span>.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the final expression to the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤمناتٍ: مجموع مؤنث سالم منصوب بالكسرة؛ أحمدَ: مجرور بالفتحة؛ المعلّمون: مرفوع بالواو؛ القاضيَ: منصوب بالفتحة الظاهرة</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Endings and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت مؤمنات</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة للنصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء للجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة للنصب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بأحمد، غير منصرف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة للجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة للجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة للنصب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو للرفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف للرفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون للرفع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت القاضي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة ظاهرة للنصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة مقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء للنصب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the complete correction of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بأخوك</span></b> using the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأسماء الخمسة</span> pattern.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>, expressed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد مضاف إلى غير ياء المتكلم</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بأخوك؛ أخو مبني على الواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بأخيك؛ أخي مجرور بالياء والكاف مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بأخاك؛ أخا منصوب بالألف</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر الفتى صباحَ مساءَ. سلّم على المعلّمين كليهما</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمان اثنان</span>. Analyse the selected expressions.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف. سلّم</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر هو يعود إلى الفتى. على</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمين</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كليهما</span> follows it as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد مجرور بالياء؛ هما مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Connected reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مبني على السكون</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صباح مساء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مبني على فتح الجزأين في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمان مجروران</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف ومضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالياء لأنه مجموع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كليهما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد مجرور بالياء، وهو مضاف إلى ضمير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أبي من قبلُ. أكرمتُ معلّميَّ</span>.</b> The omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل</span> is intended; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّميَّ</span> means several teachers. Use this module’s analysis.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إلى ياء المتكلم</span>, excluding the ordinary letter pattern. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبل</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء عارض</span> under the stated omission <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط. معلّميّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع مذكر سالم مضاف إلى ياء المتكلم</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالياء</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Connected reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة والياء مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو الظاهرة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بفتحة مقدّرة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّميَّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو المقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء والياء الأخرى مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بفتحة ظاهرة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ أخاكَ</span>.</b>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل وفاعل. أخاك</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به: أخا منصوب بالألف من الأسماء الخمسة، وهو مضاف؛ الكاف مضاف إليه</span>. The whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتدائية لا محل لها من الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأى في رأيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مبني على الضم في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالألف، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مبني على الفتح في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خالدٌ بظالمٍ</span>.</b> Take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العاملة عمل ليس</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تنفي وتعمل عمل ليس. خالد اسمها مرفوع؛ ظالم خبرها منصوب محلًّا رغم الكسرة التي أوجبتها الباء الزائدة. الجملة ابتدائية لا محل لها</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي يعمل عمل ليس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام مبتدأ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ما مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر زائد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظالم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور محلًّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما مرفوع لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما مجرور لفظًا منصوب محلًّا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحّح الأحكام باختيار البديل الصحيح</span>.", "sol": "<p>Separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> from role, lack of visible change from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, and a meaning family from its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب استثناء</span>. In the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط, أيّ مفعول به منصوب ومضاف؛ كتاب مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Cumulative distinctions", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل كسرة تدل على جر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل كسرة علامة رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد تدل على نصب مجموع المؤنث السالم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل كسرة بناء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ثابت الآخر مبني</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ثابت الآخر حرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ثابت الآخر فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يكون معربًا بإعراب تقديري</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل اسم شرط مبني، ومنها أيّ دائمًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ حرف جر دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ اسم صوت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ معربة في أيَّ كتابٍ تقرأْ تستفدْ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "D2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعتُ</span> «<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ حاضرٌ</span>».</b> The quoted words are being reproduced exactly. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التحليل</span>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعت</span>. The quoted wording occupies the outer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> role while preserving <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضرٌ خبر</span> internally.</p>", "group": "D|Cumulative distinctions", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب تغييرها إلى خالدًا حاضرًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العبارة محكية في محل نصب مفعول به مع بقاء ضبطها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد فاعل لسمعت</span>"], "ans": 1}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>Check that you can distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظي، تقديري، محلّي</span>; apply each family’s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>; explain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء أصلي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عارض</span>; and keep a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محكي</span> unchanged while identifying its outer <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>. If you miss an answer, name the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> you overlooked before trying again.</p>"}], "revisit": "<p>For confusion about role versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>, revisit Lessons 1–2. For letter patterns and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>, revisit Lessons 3–5. For layered relationships, revisit Lesson 6. For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>, revisit Lessons 7–10.</p>"};
